I've got a rather nice priestess (> 400 HP, > 500 power, etc.). Saved
the game on the Asmodeus Level (didn't know I was there at the time).
Restore the game the next day and...segmentation fault (core dump). Hm.
I'm running on a Sparc IPX with SunOS 4.1.1. Lots of disc space, no
problem there. Poked around a bit. The save file uncompressed to about
850K, and NH proceeded to make MANY alock and block files. Why a and b?
Tried all sorts of things, started to panic (mildly), then tried things
like "recover Velwin" (my character is Velwin, and maybe I didn't read
the man pages very carefully in my confusion but it wasn't obvious to
me what the argument to "recover" should be), "recover 79Velwin" (79 is
my group ID), then "recover alock" (just by chance), didn't quite work
("79Velwin:  permission denied" -- all the mod flags were off, so I
just removed the file), "recover alock" again and Lo! The Gods Seem
Pleased! My save file was rewritten (it was about 25% smaller), I
restored it, and everything seemed to work fine.

So, thanks a lot for the "recover" problem, but what went wrong in the
first place???

Derek

